<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16663] Test WriteAheadLogManagerSelfTest.testNoRaceAutoArchiveAndDeactivation is flaky on TC</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16663</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16523&quot; title=&quot;WALForceArchiveTimeout lead to node fails to restart&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-16523&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-16523&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; was implemented test WriteAheadLogManagerSelfTest.testNoRaceAutoArchiveAndDeactivation has become flaky on TC.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;TC history for the test is available &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/test/6527190802482126571?currentProjectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;branch=%3Cdefault%3E&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test fails on an assertion in test logic:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            GridTimeoutObject timeoutObj = timeoutRollover(n);
            assertNotNull(timeoutObj);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It looks like latest improvements in WAL related to CDC feature could bring new race here.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
